---
args: { prepared: PreparedEvidence, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Interpret prose requirements, bug reports, and relevant discussion to identify observable behavior, preconditions, and exclusions. Separate implementation suggestions from requirements and preserve ambiguous expectations for owner resolution before encoding them as tests.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
